  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Plays one exchange from the start positions until a fighter falls, the time ends or a start key comes. Returns A: $80 key, the reaction move, or 1 time up."},
    {"at":0,"placement":"side","text":"Only the bull test sets the offset nonzero."},
    {"at":29,"placement":"side","text":"Waits for raster line $fd, then does one frame."},
    {"at":55,"placement":"side","text":"A start key in the demo ends the bout with A = $80."},
    {"at":57,"placement":"side","text":"A fall ends the exchange."},
    {"at":69,"placement":"side","text":"The clock runs only after fighter 0 leaves the starting move $17."},
    {"at":82,"placement":"side","text":"Time up: both fighters show frame $37 on the ground."},
    {"at":113,"placement":"line","text":"Cold start: initialises the machine and enters the title loop."}
  ],
